Container image
---------------

7. The runtime image is based on gcr.io/distroless/static-debian13, which
   contains a few Debian packages (base files, CA certificates, time zone
   data, netbase). Their copyright and license files are inside the image
   under /usr/share/doc/.

Build and test tools (not distributed)
--------------------------------------

esbuild (MIT), TypeScript (Apache-2.0) and playwright-core (Apache-2.0) are
used only to build and test Nullbin. They are not part of any shipped file.
